// The pictures the demo's agent browser shows: three pages of a notes
// app that keeps working offline, as a phone is sent them -- 640x400
// JPEG, the phone size's dimensions (`protocol::BrowserViewSize::Phone`).
//
// Drawn, not captured: three mock pages of invented notes, rendered by
// Playwright's headless shell at the browser's 1280x800 and scaled to the
// phone's size at JPEG quality 30 (a phone's stream is 50; these ship in
// the bundle, where every kilobyte is downloaded by every phone). To
// change one, render the page the same way and base64 the file.

/// The notes list, online.
export const NOTES_HOME = "";

/// A note being edited with the network off: the change is kept on the
/// device until it is back.
export const NOTE_OFFLINE_EDIT = "";

/// Back online, and the change sent.
export const NOTES_SYNCED = "";
